AlgoClerk is inspired by the genre of programming puzzle games and by classic
algorithm interview topics. It contains no assets, text, level designs or
names from any other game or website. See CREDITS.md for third-party
components, fonts and their licences.

The pixel-art engine design (palette, sprite and font formats, canvas, text-song
synthesiser, integer-scaled virtual screen) and the Bevy shell structure are
adapted from the sibling project Falabichos (Apache-2.0, same owner). All
AlgoClerk art, music, levels and text are original.
